+instance.  Even positions and odd positions around it receive independent
+noncrossing perfect matchings, on opposite pages, giving every vertex degree
+three.  A uniform final relabeling makes both a planted cycle edge and a decoy
+matching edge marginally uniform over unordered labels; neither labels,
+degrees, nor one-vertex statistics expose the answer.  The panel tests a local
+signature ordering, constrained greedy path growth, randomized restarts,
+spectral circular seriation, and the cubic-graph standard reduction that
+enumerates perfect matchings and tests whether the complementary 2-factor is
