Implemented the generator and all local verification gates pass.

Key results:

- Track A, native `[1,1]-HAM` on cubic graphs, using the hard regime of Theorem 1 in the [paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.16270).
- Guessing: 0/200,000.
- Six attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Exact baseline: 800,008 branch nodes, 79.856 seconds.
- Answer: 371 characters, 120 elements, 240 intended operations.
- Canonical-key tests: 60/60 invariant, 20/20 unrelated instances distinct.

