One nuance matters before I label the outcome: the last legal rung fails H, but the only remaining difficulty axis is larger `n`, which also lengthens the spanning-cycle witness. Under the task’s rules that may be `cap_bound` (parked), not a paper rejection. I’m checking just beyond the 300-operation cap to distinguish “the distribution never becomes hard” from “it becomes hard only after the answer-format cap binds.”
