/tmp/2405.16270-src.c2cxlz/main.tex:441:\item The gadget cannot be connected if an attachment edge is labeled less than $2k + 1$.
/tmp/2405.16270-src.c2cxlz/main.tex:451:        \label{fig:maxdeg-edge-gadget}
