The four-vertex exchange is behaving as intended through six seeds: it creates 16 local parity defects in every instance, the −1-eigenspace projector has 0/6 successes, and the standard exact attack has exhausted all 120,012 nodes on each seed. Two seeds remain, followed by the stronger “recover approximate parity and repair the defect set” probe.
