codex
The small-mix construction clears the added approximate-parity repair attack at the cap rung: 0/8 successes after 64 min-conflict restarts plus a 20,000-node prioritized repair search per seed. I’m now running the full standard 120,000-node attack at `n=256`; this is the final local hardness gate, because any further size increase would exceed the witness atom cap.
