codex
The oracle blocker means no shipping level can be selected by STEP 4 yet. Before freezing the README, I’m checking one pipeline subtlety: if the oracle later holds the first `easy` rung, that rung must also clear G6. The old `n=220` rung does not, so I’m testing the same final construction at `n=240`; if it clears, I’ll slide the non-demo ladder up so a future hardening run cannot stop on a locally invalid preset.
