codex
`n=240` is not admissible: the standard search found a witness on seed 9106 after 38,849 nodes. I’m testing the narrow cap-adjacent ladder instead (`252`, `254`, `256` vertices); this keeps every prospective oracle-held rung under 256 answer atoms while preserving strictly increasing `n`.
