+## Problem and construction
 
-This module instantiates Definition 1 of Liu, Sheffield, and Westover,
-[“Complexity of Multiple-Hamiltonicity in Graphs of Bounded Degree”](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.16270).
-The solver receives a simple undirected 3-regular graph and must exhibit a closed
